WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.229
Good evening. Here is tomorrow's weather for the island.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.305
A band of cloud crosses from the west during the morning.

00:00:10.505 --> 00:00:12.457
Behind it, the sky clears.

00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:19.400
Temperatures reach fourteen degrees on the north coast, eleven in the highlands, and seventeen in the harbour.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.295
On the north coast, expect a fresh westerly wind.

00:00:25.495 --> 00:00:28.986
Around midday, gusts reach sixty kilometres an hour.

00:00:29.186 --> 00:00:31.011
By evening, it eases.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.211
In the highlands, rain arrives early and stays until the afternoon.

00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:40.510
Around noon, it will be heavy.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.738
Take care on the mountain paths.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.548
The harbour stays dry.

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:51.327
After a grey start, there will be nine hours of sunshine.

00:00:51.527 --> 00:00:55.789
Sunrise is at six twenty-one, sunset at eight forty-seven.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.335
And the days ahead.

00:01:00.535 --> 00:01:05.059
Showers on Thursday, sunshine on Friday, and a warm, still Saturday.

00:01:05.259 --> 00:01:07.388
That is the weather. Good night.

